uploads/origins/633bf7ab-1190-4c39-9caf-65cbf5f5e45c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0db77b7fd6a9291000fc33fbf70438b8 3x"}, "body": "Hello!\nI'm a big fan of your art that features sexy robot women with very large breasts:\nhttps://x.com/juerucj/status/1774416897209139596\nhttps://x.com/juerucj/status/1811233765752197592\nhttps://x.com/juerucj/status/1781548269627465818\n... and I would like you to draw a similar character for me.\n\nThe robot body is from the game \"Call of Duty: Infinite Warfare\" and you can see examples in the reference folder. Please change the shape of the body to be more feminine and sexy (wide hips, slim waist). Please make sure that she has very large breasts (at least as big as her 'head').\n\nThere is a folder of references for several different weapons. You can pick the one that appeals to you the most, or include more than one in the scene if you wish.\n\nFor the scene, I was thinking that she could be relaxing and sitting on a crate after a battle in a sexy pin-up style pose. If you want to include a background, it could be a hangar on a spaceship or military base. These ideas are just for inspiration, if you have a different idea you think looks better you can ignore this suggestion.\n\nIf the price is not appropriate for the request, you can use Skeb appeal to increase the price.\n\nThank you for considering my request!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1i3J_aVEGLs36X-zXunqXaN6bO6tTqsY1?usp=sharing", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@juerucj/works/10", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2948986, "client_id": 627233, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3b61324/uploads/origins/4ea2ed00-0041-4065-9e2d-13461c8709c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b79a42b7e62a56c85e846c9072799749", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a3b61324/uploads/origins/4ea2ed00-0041-4065-9e2d-13461c8709c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b79a42b7e62a56c85e846c9072799749, https://si.imgix.net/a3b61324/uploads/origins/4ea2ed00-0041-4065-9e2d-13461c8709c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1649f0b288bd5cd0eb919de463f6860a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a3b61324/uploads/origins/4ea2ed00-0041-4065-9e2d-13461c8709c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c3a539239acd4a7028f3b86fa431205e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/a3b61324/uploads/origins/4ea2ed00-0041-4065-9e2d-13461c8709c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b9b285a80b8e495c38ca5239b046bfc", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a3b61324/uploads/origins/4ea2ed00-0041-4065-9e2d-13461c8709c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0b9b285a80b8e495c38ca5239b046bfc, https://si.imgix.net/a3b61324/uploads/origins/4ea2ed00-0041-4065-9e2d-13461c8709c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=179216b78c81812efedcb6994e84505f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a3b61324/uploads/origins/4ea2ed00-0041-4065-9e2d-13461c8709c2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2f4cd506515558bdfd917efb33e4ae6a 3x"}, "body": "Hello there!\n\nI would like a drawing of my OC. (https://imgur.com/a/diesel-P26fJtn) You can give him any pose you want. He is an arcade engineer who had to become a vampire hunter because Earth was invaded by vampires. He protects the princess of the vampires because she fled from her kingdom to warn the humans.\n\nYou can give any pose you want but if you want me to choose, use this one (https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/devilmaycry/images/8/89/Dmc2_trish_render.png/revision/latest?cb=20200814154219)\n\nThe background can be similar to this (https://cdn.wallpapersafari.com/98/23/R7N4rS.jpg)\n\nFeel free to decline if it's too low. Thank you so much regardless!", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@juerucj/works/9", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2948986, "client_id": 2266224, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c43df026/uploads/origins/5a662d39-6a04-4b29-bbd1-0bf9dd993727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bdae44fc7d59198da08bf14a39f7c60a", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c43df026/uploads/origins/5a662d39-6a04-4b29-bbd1-0bf9dd993727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bdae44fc7d59198da08bf14a39f7c60a, https://si.imgix.net/c43df026/uploads/origins/5a662d39-6a04-4b29-bbd1-0bf9dd993727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2b6d4f69267d03a13d733fb4b42a5502 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c43df026/uploads/origins/5a662d39-6a04-4b29-bbd1-0bf9dd993727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8bb9e9ea79a003b6e8bbe74f695bc41a 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c43df026/uploads/origins/5a662d39-6a04-4b29-bbd1-0bf9dd993727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f299879844a6b58a8453ebaab723715", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c43df026/uploads/origins/5a662d39-6a04-4b29-bbd1-0bf9dd993727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=0f299879844a6b58a8453ebaab723715, https://si.imgix.net/c43df026/uploads/origins/5a662d39-6a04-4b29-bbd1-0bf9dd993727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=032eb051ec50d227042940eb296e3539 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c43df026/uploads/origins/5a662d39-6a04-4b29-bbd1-0bf9dd993727?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5c0f3ba830e2b61a50e34936311b0ae2 3x"}, "body": "My name is díː, an indie game creator, and I usually enjoy seeing your detailed and stylish illustrations. I would like to send a request to Mr. Jewel the Scribe Bird.\n\nThe contents of the request\nI would like you to design a costume for Willian of my work Alternative Alliance Alpha (AL2α).\n\nUsage\nDisplay on my SNS account and website\nReference design for my games and illustrations\nUse in my own games.\n\nSupplemental information on usage\nAlthough the game is currently a free game, there is a possibility that it will be charged for in the future, and since I have already released another commercial work, it will be used for commercial purposes as well.\nWhen referring to the original design, we may omit or change the design depending on the pattern or seasonal events.\nWe will not use the illustration itself for the production of goods, but we may use the illustration drawn in reference to the design we receive to produce goods.\n\n◆Details of the character\nHeight: about 180cm, body: slender\nThe skin is visible in the part of the body that imitates a crow (bird) (inside is human and wears a full body suit).\nHis personality is calm and his tension is always low. He is always calm and low tension. He is good at taking care of people. Eats well.\n\nRequests\nShoes and coat suitable for long term outdoor activities in rough desert (low temperature and humidity, not below zero).\nNo head protection needed, as the crow's head is a substitute for a helmet.\nFuturistic design (technology can reduce the weight and size of elements that would be heavy equipment today).\nThe colors are mainly achromatic and cold colors.\nLarge backpacks on the back (for carrying goods and souvenirs)\n\n◆Documents\nWillian's current design\nhttps://dear-done-dead.games/materials/al2alpha_willian.png\nMain body of the game\nhttps://unityroom.com/games/al2alpha\n\nPlease cancel if there are any problems. Thank you for your consideration.", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@juerucj/works/8", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2948986, "client_id": 1672756, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/222d145f/uploads/origins/9cb3e171-fe93-452d-9e95-31667820d69f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39bb244664fe7320cc53e5ea2d3b61a0", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/222d145f/uploads/origins/9cb3e171-fe93-452d-9e95-31667820d69f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=39bb244664fe7320cc53e5ea2d3b61a0, https://si.imgix.net/222d145f/uploads/origins/9cb3e171-fe93-452d-9e95-31667820d69f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a6944e9c38ac20cedd3d55955b4cdd42 2x, https://si.imgix.net/222d145f/uploads/origins/9cb3e171-fe93-452d-9e95-31667820d69f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=6f4c2e62662de2f4688f717e19421b82 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/222d145f/uploads/origins/9cb3e171-fe93-452d-9e95-31667820d69f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff8c736d65f5085857c2df0bf03fe402", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/222d145f/uploads/origins/9cb3e171-fe93-452d-9e95-31667820d69f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=ff8c736d65f5085857c2df0bf03fe402, https://si.imgix.net/222d145f/uploads/origins/9cb3e171-fe93-452d-9e95-31667820d69f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9142b7283d3645fec780f97cb