oads/origins/6b372493-1683-4ecf-a39b-6596334f6984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=2a2e571f47e9bc1bf5d1377b42b4b8f8 2x, https://si.imgix.net/aee17ecb/uploads/origins/6b372493-1683-4ecf-a39b-6596334f6984?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=12c57b39ad0101868dbb576c544cb4d5 3x"}, "body": "Hello, how are you? Thank you for drawing Ninja-chan! It's amazing!\nhttps://skeb.jp/@juerucj/works/4\n\nMay I make one more request?\nThis is Chiundee. She is the final boss of the game Geostorm (by the creators of Metal Slug). She is an intimidating robot with a nice figure and a snake-like body, would you like to draw her?\n\nThis is my favorite robot girl and I would love to have you draw her, the pose and composition is up to you,\nIf you prefer a specific pose, how about this Skeb-like pose with her arms pulled back? :.\nhttps://skeb.jp/@juerucj/works/1\nThe background can be similar to the screenshot in the folder\n\nI hope you will consider this, thank you!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1kC7wal-OQ8Gxg6xnOets4VCygKjL7LDH?usp=drive_link", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@juerucj/works/6", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2948986, "client_id": 3133038, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0052622/uploads/origins/7eb160df-10c9-4dc1-a43d-d13c78485bfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a6979613d0d79d14f7fb40c9c4a8e2d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0052622/uploads/origins/7eb160df-10c9-4dc1-a43d-d13c78485bfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7a6979613d0d79d14f7fb40c9c4a8e2d, https://si.imgix.net/d0052622/uploads/origins/7eb160df-10c9-4dc1-a43d-d13c78485bfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2256552e604281bc6eee5291886b2674 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d0052622/uploads/origins/7eb160df-10c9-4dc1-a43d-d13c78485bfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ea3be1c78e4a50a3486e87cc457a028c 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d0052622/uploads/origins/7eb160df-10c9-4dc1-a43d-d13c78485bfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a504c962366ee7de7b10d5d9fb48980", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d0052622/uploads/origins/7eb160df-10c9-4dc1-a43d-d13c78485bfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6a504c962366ee7de7b10d5d9fb48980, https://si.imgix.net/d0052622/uploads/origins/7eb160df-10c9-4dc1-a43d-d13c78485bfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=058ea32c193d5e990c885fa2278768be 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d0052622/uploads/origins/7eb160df-10c9-4dc1-a43d-d13c78485bfa?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=3be455793dba4b0d3930915b807cf63f 3x"}, "body": "Good evening.\nI have been a fan since Rikku☆Jia~s Type 90 Tank II, Chieftain Mk.11, etc.\n\nThe illustration I would like to request is an anthropomorphic illustration of the Trojan AVRE, a British Army combat engineer vehicle.\nFor details,\nThe base Trojan AVRE is equipped with a mine clearance plow on the front of the body.\nThe gender is female, and I would like her to have a calm face. I would like her to have a calm face, like the one of Katsuta Higashi, a garrison girl, in the initial draft.\nWe would be very happy if her physique is slightly muscular, but has a rich feminine silhouette.\nWe will leave it up to you to decide how much or how little skin to expose, but it would be better if the exposed skin has some light old scars.\nAs for the clothing, we would prefer a jacket and sports bra for the upper body and combat uniform and half boots for the lower body, as in Katsuta Azuma's initial proposal. However, if light clothing is not appropriate for the concept of a combat-uniformed engineering vehicle, please use the upper and lower body as combat uniform.\nThe color of the body should be khaki green. The hair and skin color should be similar to Chieftain Mk.11 of \"Rick-Jee-A-Su.\nAs for the bundle of iron pipes, we will leave it up to you whether or not to draw it. However, if you can draw it, it would be preferable if it is grasped by a shovel arm.\nI would like to see a shovel arm on the right shoulder, a plow on the right arm, and an L94A1 chain gun in the left hand, which would be more like a Trojan AVRE.\nThe above are just my requests, so I will leave the coloring and composition of the body to you.\n\nIf you can draw the illustration, I would like to use it as a standby image on my smartphone or in my X-account image.\nThank you in advance for your consideration.", "nc": 144, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@juerucj/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 2948986, "client_id": 53582, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/501eac30/uploads/origins/32a54ec7-4e95-4ce0-878b-69ac5f738032?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74f5bf625e5566075a7e793b93285df6", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/501eac30/uploads/origins/32a54ec7-4e95-4ce0-878b-69ac5f738032?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74f5bf625e5566075a7e793b93285df6, https://si.imgix.net/501eac30/uploads/origins/32a54ec7-4e95-4ce0-878b-69ac5f738032?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dbf6df66f7e85de2d0b5128aa8ec35a3 2x, https://si.imgix.net/501eac30/uploads/origins/32a54ec7-4e95-4ce0-878b-69ac5f738032?bg=%23fff&auto=form